*** Settings ***
Documentation       Technical helper keywords for databases. Only here are keywords of the DatabaseLibrary used.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/abilities/database_ability.resource
Keyword Tags        interaction


*** Keywords ***
Connect To Example Database
    [Documentation]    Connects to the example database (details in the ability).
    Connect To Database    ${EXAMPLE_DB_MODULE}    database=${EXAMPLE_DB_NAME}    isolation_level=${None}
{%- if database_driver != 'sqlite' %}

Connect To Own Database
    [Documentation]    Connects to your own database (details in the ability).
    Connect To Database    ${DB_MODULE}    ${DB_NAME}    ${DB_USER}    ${DB_PASSWORD}    ${DB_HOST}    ${DB_PORT}
{%- endif %}

Run Sql
    [Documentation]    Runs an SQL statement that creates, changes or deletes data.
    [Arguments]    ${sql}
    Execute Sql String    ${sql}

Read Rows
    [Documentation]    Runs an SQL query and returns the rows.
    [Arguments]    ${sql}
    ${rows}    Query    ${sql}
    RETURN    ${rows}

Disconnect Database
    [Documentation]    Closes the connection to the database.
    Disconnect From Database
